# The investor deck: the PDF is sealed into deck/sealed by scripts/deck/seal.mjs
# and the watermark font is copied into deck/fonts from node_modules. Both are
# generated, derived from a private source, and must never enter this public
# repo. Re-run `npm run deck:seal -- <deck.pdf>` on any machine that serves it.
